### User Service - Auth Login
### Single-purpose file for login requests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@apiVersion = /api/v1
@contentType = application/json

### Login with existing user credentials
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiVersion}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "alice.johnson@bennycar.de",
  "password": "SecureAdminPass2024!"
}

> {%
    client.assert(response.status === 200, "Login failed");
    client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken);
    client.global.set("refreshToken", response.body.refreshToken);
%}